%description:

Tcp.mtuProbing:search-icmp -- a Fragmentation Needed of the route limits the search to its MTU.

The claim (Tcp.ned): "RFC 4821 - Packetization Layer Path MTU Discovery. By parameter
(mtuProbing = 2 ...): a search between baseMss and the MSS of the peer, with one probe segment
from queued data ... The route MTU bounds the search".

The class search-icmp: TcpConnection::processIcmpv4Error() of a connection with PMTUD and the
search calls limitMtuSearch(), which sets the top of the search to the MTU of the ICMP
error. This facet comes from the coverage gap loop: no test reached the code of this part. This test separates "search" from "off", whose first data segment has the MSS of
the handshake.

Host under test: host1, with PMTUD (the default); the network is TapRouterNetwork, and the
interface of the router to host2 has an MTU of 1200 bytes. host1 sends 1000000 bytes at 0.2 s.
Observation: level 1, the first data frame carries 1076 bytes (the base MSS), a probe above
1200 bytes goes, and after it no frame of host1 is above 1200 bytes, while a frame above 1150
bytes comes.

%# parameter: Tcp.mtuProbing
%# class: search-icmp
%# value: 2
%# key: *.host1.tcp.mtuProbing
%# expected-result: PASS

%includes:
#include "ProtocolTest.h"

%global:

using namespace inet;
using namespace inet::protocoltest;

Define_ProtocolTestProgram()
{
    return ProtocolTest("TcpMtuProbingSearchIcmp")
        .once(on("host1.eth[0].mac").signal("packetSentToLower")
             .filterPacket("ipv4.totalLengthField > 100B")
             .first()
                  .assertPacket("ipv4.totalLengthField == 1076B")
             .describe("the first data frame of host1")
             .within(0.5))
        .once(on("host1.eth[0].mac").signal("packetSentToLower")
             .filterPacket("ipv4.totalLengthField > 1200B")
             .describe("a probe above the MTU of the route")
             .within(1.5))
        .meanwhile(never(on("host1.eth[0].mac").signal("packetSentToLower")
                             .filterPacket("ipv4.totalLengthField > 1200B")
                             .describe("a frame above 1200 bytes after the ICMP error")
                             .within(2.0)))
        .once(on("host1.eth[0].mac").signal("packetSentToLower")
             .filterPacket("ipv4.totalLengthField > 1150B && ipv4.totalLengthField <= 1200B")
             .describe("a frame near the MTU of the route")
             .within(2.0));
}

%activity:
EV << "TcpMtuProbingSearchIcmp compiled\n";

%inifile: omnetpp.ini

[General]
*.host1.tcp.mtuProbing = 2    # the parameter under test
network = inet.protocoltest.TapRouterNetwork
*.router.eth[1].mac.mtu = 1200B
*.host1.app[0].sendBytes = 1000000B
sim-time-limit = 4s
include ../../parameter/ini/_bulk.ini
include ../../parameter/ini/_base.ini

%contains: stdout
PROTOCOLTEST TcpMtuProbingSearchIcmp: PASS
